==Battleground==
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Box Witch and Minions]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

